OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation launched on city's
OL,4,A20-year plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA final public consultation has been
OL,7,Flaunched on a blueprint that will shape
OL,8,Ffuture housing and development across
OL,9,FPeterborough.
OL,11,FThe council's cabinet voted to put the
OL,12,FLocal Plan out for consultation on
OL,13,FThursday, giving residents the
OL,14,Fopportunity to comment on a document
OL,15,Fthat will guide planning decisions for
OL,16,Fthe next 20 years.
OL,18,FIt sets out where development should
OL,19,Fand should not take place and
OL,20,Fidentifies land that should be
OL,21,Fprotected.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
